WEBVTT

00:02:58.916 --> 00:03:01.636
When I first heard
about the Standard Model,

00:03:01.676 --> 00:03:03.356
it really blew my mind

00:03:03.396 --> 00:03:07.436
and gave me the passion
to focus on my studies in physics.

00:03:09.516 --> 00:03:10.676
But I also knew

00:03:10.716 --> 00:03:13.436
that I would have to think about them
a little differently

00:03:13.436 --> 00:03:15.636
to my fellow students.

00:03:16.796 --> 00:03:22.036
For example, I had to demonstrate
in examinations that I had understood

00:03:22.036 --> 00:03:25.036
the practical techniques
that I had been taught.

00:03:26.756 --> 00:03:28.356
Due to my disability,

00:03:28.396 --> 00:03:31.196
I don't have enough control of my hands